WEBVTT

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:02.016
And even though you
cannot believe this is happening,

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:05.696
even though you are
hallucinating with fear,

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.576
you hear yourself say it,

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.960
"I am ready, I am ready, let's go!"

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.800
FB: Episode one.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:22.896
JM: Everyone always wants to know
how we became sisters.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.536
"How did you two meet?"
Like we're a married couple.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.696
I like to say we met online.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.736
(Laughter)

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:33.736
FB: We met at the Nuyorican
Poets Café in 1999.